<title>CANADA: Canadian leader heading to Seoul, Manila, Bangkok.</title>
<headline>Canadian leader heading to Seoul, Manila, Bangkok.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canadian Prime Minister Jean Chretien said on Monday he would lead a trade mission next month to South Korea, the Philippines and Thailand.</p>
<p>He will be following his trademark &quot;Team Canada&quot; format, taking provincial premiers along.</p>
<p>The government says deals worth more than Canadian $20 billion (US$15 billion) were signed during two Team Canada missions to China in 1994 and several other Asian countries in January 1996, as well as a smaller mission to Latin America.</p>
<p>He will be in Seoul January 9-14, Manila January 14-16, and Bangkok January 16-20.</p>
</text>
